OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry start with sunny spells.
OL,6,FCloud will increase through the
OL,7,Fmorning to bring a few showers, these
OL,8,Fmostly light in nature. Best of the
OL,9,Fsunny spells will be along the east
OL,10,Fcoast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA bright evening with any
OL,13,Fshowers dying out. A dry start to the
OL,14,Fnight but thicker cloud and patchy
OL,15,Frain will spread eastwards later.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSunday:FA mostly cloudy day with
OL,18,Foutbreaks of rain. Best chance of dry
OL,19,Fand bright spells will be in the east.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
