OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FA dry
OL,6,Fstart to Monday then rain spreading
OL,7,Feastwards. Mainly dry on Tuesday then
OL,8,Fbright spells and showers on Wednesday.
